>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SOURCE-LANGUAGE-CATALOG.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
78 CATALOG-VERSION VALUE 1.
01 CUTLET-TABLE.
   05 CUTLET-ROW OCCURS 17 TIMES.
      10 CUTLET-CANONICAL-INDEX PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
      10 CUTLET-TEXT PIC X(96).
01 MONTH-TABLE.
   05 MONTH-ROW OCCURS 47 TIMES.
      10 MONTH-CANONICAL-INDEX PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
      10 MONTH-TEXT PIC X(96).
01 CATALOG-READY PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 WS-I PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LK-ACTION PIC X(12).
01 LK-KIND PIC X(8).
01 LK-INDEX PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
01 LK-VERSION PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
01 LK-TEXT PIC X(96).
01 LK-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5.

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-ACTION LK-KIND LK-INDEX LK-VERSION LK-TEXT LK-STATUS.
MAIN.
    IF CATALOG-READY = 0
        PERFORM LOAD-CATALOG
        MOVE 1 TO CATALOG-READY
    END-IF

    MOVE SPACES TO LK-TEXT
    MOVE CATALOG-VERSION TO LK-VERSION
    MOVE 0 TO LK-STATUS

    EVALUATE FUNCTION TRIM(LK-ACTION)
        WHEN "GET"
            PERFORM GET-ENTRY
        WHEN "VALIDATE"
            PERFORM VALIDATE-CATALOG
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 11 TO LK-STATUS
    END-EVALUATE
    GOBACK.

GET-ENTRY.
    EVALUATE FUNCTION TRIM(LK-KIND)
        WHEN "CUTLET"
            IF LK-INDEX < 1 OR LK-INDEX > 17
                MOVE 10 TO LK-STATUS
            ELSE
                IF CUTLET-CANONICAL-INDEX(LK-INDEX) NOT = LK-INDEX
                    MOVE 12 TO LK-STATUS
                ELSE
                    MOVE CUTLET-TEXT(LK-INDEX) TO LK-TEXT
                END-IF
            END-IF
        WHEN "MONTH"
            IF LK-INDEX < 1 OR LK-INDEX > 47
                MOVE 10 TO LK-STATUS
            ELSE
                IF MONTH-CANONICAL-INDEX(LK-INDEX) NOT = LK-INDEX
                    MOVE 12 TO LK-STATUS
                ELSE
                    MOVE MONTH-TEXT(LK-INDEX) TO LK-TEXT
                END-IF
            END-IF
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 11 TO LK-STATUS
    END-EVALUATE.

VALIDATE-CATALOG.
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 17
        IF CUTLET-CANONICAL-INDEX(WS-I) NOT = WS-I
            MOVE 12 TO LK-STATUS
            EXIT PERFORM
        END-IF
        IF FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(CUTLET-TEXT(WS-I))) = 0
            MOVE 13 TO LK-STATUS
            EXIT PERFORM
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    IF LK-STATUS = 0
        PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 47
            IF MONTH-CANONICAL-INDEX(WS-I) NOT = WS-I
                MOVE 12 TO LK-STATUS
                EXIT PERFORM
            END-IF
            IF FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(MONTH-TEXT(WS-I))) = 0
                MOVE 13 TO LK-STATUS
                EXIT PERFORM
            END-IF
        END-PERFORM
    END-IF.

LOAD-CATALOG.
    *> 这些字符串只负责最终展示。规范排序、rank、unrank 与选择只使用 canonicalIndex。
    *> 有词义的名称按词义翻译；地名和无词义音串按固定普通话音译规则转写。
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 17
        MOVE WS-I TO CUTLET-CANONICAL-INDEX(WS-I)
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 47
        MOVE WS-I TO MONTH-CANONICAL-INDEX(WS-I)
    END-PERFORM

    MOVE "青铜" TO CUTLET-TEXT(1)
    MOVE "狐狸" TO CUTLET-TEXT(2)
    MOVE "肾脏" TO CUTLET-TEXT(3)
    MOVE "拉格什" TO CUTLET-TEXT(4)
    MOVE "思想" TO CUTLET-TEXT(5)
    MOVE "九分之四" TO CUTLET-TEXT(6)
    MOVE "帕尔古拉什" TO CUTLET-TEXT(7)
    MOVE "莎草" TO CUTLET-TEXT(8)
    MOVE "簇" TO CUTLET-TEXT(9)
    MOVE "蝎子" TO CUTLET-TEXT(10)
    MOVE "灰烬" TO CUTLET-TEXT(11)
    MOVE "小麦" TO CUTLET-TEXT(12)
    MOVE "河流" TO CUTLET-TEXT(13)
    MOVE "笑声" TO CUTLET-TEXT(14)
    MOVE "阿卡德" TO CUTLET-TEXT(15)
    MOVE "角" TO CUTLET-TEXT(16)
    MOVE "空罐" TO CUTLET-TEXT(17)

    MOVE "黏土" TO MONTH-TEXT(1)
    MOVE "石榴" TO MONTH-TEXT(2)
    MOVE "肘部" TO MONTH-TEXT(3)
    MOVE "嫉妒" TO MONTH-TEXT(4)
    MOVE "埃里都" TO MONTH-TEXT(5)
    MOVE "牙膏" TO MONTH-TEXT(6)
    MOVE "五分之三" TO MONTH-TEXT(7)
    MOVE "卡尔舒姆布" TO MONTH-TEXT(8)
    MOVE "豹" TO MONTH-TEXT(9)
    MOVE "锡" TO MONTH-TEXT(10)
    MOVE "雾" TO MONTH-TEXT(11)
    MOVE "乳香" TO MONTH-TEXT(12)
    MOVE "纺锤" TO MONTH-TEXT(13)
    MOVE "肋骨" TO MONTH-TEXT(14)
    MOVE "角豆" TO MONTH-TEXT(15)
    MOVE "乌鲁克" TO MONTH-TEXT(16)
    MOVE "羞耻" TO MONTH-TEXT(17)
    MOVE "骆驼" TO MONTH-TEXT(18)
    MOVE "铜" TO MONTH-TEXT(19)
    MOVE "水井" TO MONTH-TEXT(20)
    MOVE "蛋黄" TO MONTH-TEXT(21)
    MOVE "星星" TO MONTH-TEXT(22)
    MOVE "蜂蜜" TO MONTH-TEXT(23)
    MOVE "脾脏" TO MONTH-TEXT(24)
    MOVE "石灰岩" TO MONTH-TEXT(25)
    MOVE "喜悦" TO MONTH-TEXT(26)
    MOVE "无花果" TO MONTH-TEXT(27)
    MOVE "尼尼微" TO MONTH-TEXT(28)
    MOVE "青蛙" TO MONTH-TEXT(29)
    MOVE "沥青" TO MONTH-TEXT(30)
    MOVE "蜡烛" TO MONTH-TEXT(31)
    MOVE "紧闭的门" TO MONTH-TEXT(32)
    MOVE "芝麻" TO MONTH-TEXT(33)
    MOVE "后颈" TO MONTH-TEXT(34)
    MOVE "银" TO MONTH-TEXT(35)
    MOVE "百合" TO MONTH-TEXT(36)
    MOVE "风暴" TO MONTH-TEXT(37)
    MOVE "驴" TO MONTH-TEXT(38)
    MOVE "面粉" TO MONTH-TEXT(39)
    MOVE "懊悔" TO MONTH-TEXT(40)
    MOVE "巴比伦" TO MONTH-TEXT(41)
    MOVE "舌头" TO MONTH-TEXT(42)
    MOVE "亚麻" TO MONTH-TEXT(43)
    MOVE "盐" TO MONTH-TEXT(44)
    MOVE "梨" TO MONTH-TEXT(45)
    MOVE "弓" TO MONTH-TEXT(46)
    MOVE "沙" TO MONTH-TEXT(47).
END PROGRAM SOURCE-LANGUAGE-CATALOG.
